Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:10.48,Roger Monologue,,0,0,0,,A world... Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:16.53,Roger Monologue,,0,0,0,,A world for you who seek freedom\Nstretches out right before your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.53,0:00:20.41,Roger Monologue,,0,0,0,,If you feel guided by endless dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.41,0:00:25.17,Roger Monologue,,0,0,0,,surpass them,\Nflying the flag of your beliefs!
